{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/SteamStoreTitle_P1_ENG.png?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just 10 minutes per run! A casual roguelite RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Auto-Battle&quot; x &quot;Gear Swapping&quot; x &quot;Roguelite&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is automatic\u2014just change out weapons and outfits to build your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each 10-minute run changes based on routes and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_A2.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A nostalgic 2D RPG charm, reimagined in 3D with a fresh yet familiar feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made for those grown-up players who once dreamed of adventures like these.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_A3.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/SteamStoreTitle_P2_ENG.png?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One summer day, a mysterious creature\u2014Mogmo\u2014appears in a quiet countryside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three children set off on a journey to find where Mogmo truly belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with new friends, they cross forests and deserts in a small yet grand adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And what is the place Mogmo is meant to return to\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_B1.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mogmo has a special ability: it can eat gear to combine skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on how you feed it, you can create a one-of-a-kind skill set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_B2.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/SteamStoreTitle_P3_ENG.png?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game alternates between &quot;Town Phase&quot; and &quot;Adventure Phase.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In town, you can explore freely, enjoy the story, and interact with the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_C1.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3042\u3042\u3042</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/SteamStoreTitle_P4_ENG.png?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;Adventure Phase&quot; features auto battles as you journey toward the next town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_D1.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear found in battle can be swapped instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the combinations, unique combo actions emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_D2.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Changing gear also changes your look, letting you enjoy styles that match your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_D3.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2073980?t=1745163523","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2073980?t=1745163523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745163523","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745163523","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/SteamStoreTitle_P1_ENG.png?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just 10 minutes per run! A casual roguelite RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Auto-Battle&quot; x &quot;Gear Swapping&quot; x &quot;Roguelite&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is automatic\u2014just change out weapons and outfits to build your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each 10-minute run changes based on routes and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_A2.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A nostalgic 2D RPG charm, reimagined in 3D with a fresh yet familiar feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made for those grown-up players who once dreamed of adventures like these.</p