as/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_C1.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3042\u3042\u3042</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/SteamStoreTitle_P4_ENG.png?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;Adventure Phase&quot; features auto battles as you journey toward the next town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_D1.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear found in battle can be swapped instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the combinations, unique combo actions emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_D2.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Changing gear also changes your look, letting you enjoy styles that match your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/extras/summerroad_gameplay_Desc_D3.gif?t=1745163523\" /></p>","developers":["REBUILD GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073980/header.jpg?t=1745163523","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108960,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108960/movie480.mp4?t=1743906182","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108960/movie_max.mp4?t=1743906182"},"name":"PV 2025 02","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a